	"nodes":[
		{"id":"node-anime","type":"text","text":"## Anime\n\n### Search Anime\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/anime/search`\n- **Query Params**: `name` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Anime Details\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/anime/details/:id`\n- **Params**: `id` (number)\n- **Auth**: Public","x":-820,"y":-40,"width":350,"height":490},
		{"id":"node-1","type":"text","text":"# Aquila API Routes\n\nBase URL: `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL}`","x":-540,"y":-320,"width":400,"height":180},
		{"id":"node-manga","type":"text","text":"## Manga\n\n### Search Manga\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/manga/search`\n- **Query Params**: `name` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Manga Details\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/manga/details/:id`\n- **Params**: `id` (number)\n- **Auth**: Public","x":-340,"y":-40,"width":350,"height":490},
		{"id":"node-movie","type":"text","text":"## Movie\n\n### Search Movie\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/movie/search`\n- **Query Params**: `name` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Movie Details\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/movie/details/:id`\n- **Params**: `id` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public","x":150,"y":-40,"width":350,"height":490},
		{"id":"node-tv","type":"text","text":"## TV\n\n### Search TV\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/tv/search`\n- **Query Params**: `name` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get TV Details\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/tv/details/:id`\n- **Params**: `id` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public","x":620,"y":-40,"width":350,"height":490},
		{"id":"node-list-manga","type":"text","text":"## List Management (Manga)\n\n### Get User List\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/manga/user/:userId`\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Entry\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/manga/entry/:mangaId`\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Save Entry\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/list/manga/entry/save`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ mangaId, status, chapters, volumes, ... }` (JSON)\n\n### Delete Entry\n- **Method**: `DELETE`\n- **URL**: `/list/manga/entry/:mangaId`\n- **Auth**: Required","x":-390,"y":550,"width":450,"height":770},
		{"id":"node-list-anime","type":"text","text":"## List Management (Anime)\n\n### Get User List\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/anime/user/:userId`\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Entry\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/anime/entry/:animeId`\n- **Auth**: Required (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`)\n\n### Save Entry\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/list/anime/entry/save`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ animeId, status, progress, score, ... }` (JSON)\n\n### Delete Entry\n- **Method**: `DELETE`\n- **URL**: `/list/anime/entry/:animeId`\n- **Auth**: Required","x":-870,"y":550,"width":450,"height":770},
		{"id":"node-connections","type":"text","text":"## Connections\n\n### Find All Connections\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/connections`\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Save Connection\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/connections/save`\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Remove Connection\n- **Method**: `DELETE`\n- **URL**: `/connections/remove/:provider`\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Initiate OAuth\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/connections/:provider/connect`\n- **Query Params**: `token` (JWT)\n- **Auth**: Required (Token passed in query for redirect)\n\n### OAuth Callback\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/connections/:provider/callback`\n- **Query Params**: `code`, `state` (token)\n- **Auth**: Public (uses state token internally)","x":-1600,"y":-40,"width":450,"height":450}
	],
	"edges":[]
